        "# Annotation\n",
        "\n",
        "An annotation is metadata attached to a variable, parameter, or return value, often used to express a type hint. Python does not enforce type hints at runtime.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-annotation)"
      ]
    }
